[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14523.189, "timestamp": "04:02:03", "text": "等等，所以你只能选一个？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14526.309, "timestamp": "04:02:06", "text": "不，我最多只能带五个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14528.389, "timestamp": "04:02:08", "text": "哦好的。那东西叫什么来着？患病的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14541.349, "timestamp": "04:02:21", "text": "嗯，那个鬼叫什么名字？所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14545.55, "timestamp": "04:02:25", "text": "他的名字是……呃，Ruth Everly。露丝"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14548.229, "timestamp": "04:02:28", "text": "埃弗利。露丝，你在吗？还是你在？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14549.38, "timestamp": "04:02:29", "text": "露丝？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14560.429, "timestamp": "04:02:40", "text": "露丝，根，根。查玛，你在哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14563.67, "timestamp": "04:02:43", "text": "你？什么？哦，这是一块骨头吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14566.389, "timestamp": "04:02:46", "text": "好的，我接受。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14568.55, "timestamp": "04:02:48", "text": "是的，它放在我们大厅里。就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14570.91, "timestamp": "04:02:50", "text": "你能看到玻璃窗的地方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14574.229, "timestamp": "04:02:54", "text": "哦，是不是跟每一封“你在吗？”都一样？给"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14577.429, "timestamp": "04:02:57", "text": "这是给我们的一个信号。天哪，吓死我了。不，那个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14579.99, "timestamp": "04:02:59", "text": "吓到我了。没关系。好的。呃，我当时"}]